Guidance, Navigation, and Control

This repository contains independently written software and documentation, as
well as code or concepts derived from publicly available Sun Devil Rocketry
repositories.

Relevant upstream projects include:

- SunDevilRocketry/Flight-Computer-Firmware
- SunDevilRocketry/mod
- SunDevilRocketry/driver
- SunDevilRocketry/lib

Exact source revisions used during initial repository development are recorded
in:

    upstream/sdr-rev2/SOURCE_REVISIONS.txt

Files copied or substantially derived from upstream source must preserve their
original copyright and license notices.

Sun Devil Rocketry application code, private flight data, credentials,
generated files, and unrelated board-specific systems are not intended to be
included in the portable GNC core.
